# PostgreSQL 配置模板

## 连接配置

```json
{
  "name": "postgresql",
  "description": "PostgreSQL 数据库配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "database": "postgresql",
  "config": {
    "host": "localhost",
    "port": 5432,
    "database": "mydb",
    "user": "postgres",
    "password": "${DB_PASSWORD}",
    "ssl": "require"
  },
  "connectionString": "postgresql://user:password@host:5432/db?sslmode=require",
  "cliTools": ["psql", "pg_dump", "pg_restore"],
  "setup": {
    "install": "brew install postgresql",
    "start": "brew services start postgresql",
    "connect": "psql -h localhost -U postgres -d mydb"
  },
  "envVars": {
    "PGHOST": "localhost",
    "PGPORT": "5432",
    "PGDATABASE": "mydb",
    "PGUSER": "postgres"
  },
  "features": [
    "ACID 事务",
    "复杂查询",
    "JSON 支持",
    "全文搜索",
    "复制功能"
  ]
}
```

## 连接示例

```bash
# 使用 psql 连接
psql -h localhost -U postgres -d mydb

# 使用环境变量
export PGPASSWORD="your_password"
psql -h localhost -U postgres -d mydb
```

## 常用命令

```sql
-- 列出所有数据库
\l

-- 切换数据库
\c dbname

-- 列出所有表
\dt

-- 查看表结构
\d tablename

-- 执行 SQL 文件
\i filename.sql

-- 导出数据
\copy (SELECT * FROM table) TO '/tmp/data.csv' WITH CSV HEADER
```

## 文件位置
`templates/database/postgresql-config.json`
